xecuted\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d196\"},\"ref\":\"d196\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cristina Yang from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n4. Buffy Summers from Buffy the Vampire Slayer\\n\\n5. Olivia Pope from Scandal\\n\\n6. Rosa Diaz from Brooklyn Nine-Nine\\n\\n7. Callie Torres from Grey's Anatomy\\n\\n8. Kate Pearson from This Is Us\\n\\n9. Jane Villanueva from Jane the Virgin\\n\\n10 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/noradominick/female-tv-characters-that-inspire-us\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d188\"},\"ref\":\"d188\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2005, they won a Tony Award for their role in Spamalot, and joined Grey's shortly after.\\n\\nNow: Ramírez left Grey's after season 12, having played Dr. Callie Torres for a whopping 239 episodes. In addition to voicing Queen Miranda on the Disney animated series Sofia ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/gallery/greys-anatomy-cast-before-they-were-stars/?srsltid=AfmBOop9veMvemNQBxOptWObS-iC49SGiFhqZjNBzk87cYVuzqnbjT2L\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d185\"},\"ref\":\"d185\",\"snippet\":\" ... It's the perfect rendition of this song to match the show.\\n\\n7. Grey's Anatomy - Cosy In The Rocket by Psapp\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy is an iconic show with an iconic and recognizable theme song. The show is on season 20 and counting, and is one of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.poppassionblog.com/post/top-10-tv-show-theme-songs-that-are-real-songs\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d198\"},\"ref\":\"d198\",\"snippet\":\" ... The musical was met with widespread acclaim and Ramirez was won sever awards including the 2005 Tony Award for Best Featured Actress in a Musical.After her success on Broadway, Ramirez joined the cast of Grey's Anatomy as Dr. Calliope \\\"Callie\\\" Torres. She provided a cappella vocals ... \",\"title\":\"https://scpa.sandiegounified.org/about/alumni/notable_graduates/actors_and_actresses\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d200\"},\"ref\":\"d200\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grey's Anatomy\\n\\nLike most daughters of 'narcissistic mothers', Meredith Grey never felt loved. She spends much of the series living in the shadow of her emotionally unavailable mother and famous surgeon Ellis Grey. As the series progresses, she is finally able to carve out her own path ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.jodiegale.com/50-on-screen-mothers-and-daughters-a-collection-of-movies-and-tv-series-showing-the-many-facets-of-the-mother-daughter-relationship/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d257\"},\"ref\":\"d257\",\"snippet\":\" ... Previously In\\n\\nShe might be best known as Izzie Stevens from Grey's Anatomy, but Heigl got her start in acting as a teenager on projects like Disney Channel's Wish Upon a Star and Bride of Chucky. In 1999, she appeared as a lead in the WB ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/suits-cast-characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d258\"},\"ref\":\"d258\",\"snippet\":\" ... DO vs MD - Osteopathic vs Allopathic - What's the Difference?\\nauthor: Callie Torres November\\ndate: 2020-11-15\\n---\\nWhen visiting the doctor, chances are you didn't check what type of doctor they are – DO vs MD? Perhaps you didn't even realize that there were two different ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.umhs-sk.org/blog/do-vs-md\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d197\"},\"ref\":\"d197\",\"snippet\":\" ... Regardless of Tom's somewhat ambiguous counsel, Julie and Kevin's relationship progressed successfully, culminating in a strong marriage.\\n\\nJeremy Shelley\\n\\n(Social Networks)\\n\\nBlair McElroy, sister of former New York Jets quarterback Greg McElroy, was romantically involved with former Atlanta Falcons placekicker Jeremy Shelley. Despite any challenges they ... \",\"title\":\"https://bolavip.com/en/sports/pro-athletes-who-dated-siblings-of-other-pro-athletes-or-coaches-daughters-2\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1471b8ce3cf5f89f89d6f4879fb26ef1f92718799943ea0270cc35aae7f24aa5\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"390cfee9a868b1bd8624d16cae5db37bb5c6bf78509750988cadd365986f6ee5\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Callie Torres marriages Grey's Anatomy\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d189\"},\"ref\":\"d189\",\"snippet\":\" ... true-crime case\\n\\nHulu's 'Good American Family' with Ellen Pompeo scrambles a wild true-crime case\\n\\nNEW YORK (AP) — If Ellen Pompeo was going to find a new role after 20 years as a series regular on ABC's \\\"Grey's Anatomy,\\\" it had to be good ... \",\"title\":\"https://apnews.com/article/good-american-family-ellen-pompeo-b26604d90e695004a6e8f297cd9191f3\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_ac